          "wordIds": ["morado", "rosa", "naranja", "marrón", "cafe"]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Agreement",
          "body": "Colour adjectives agree with the noun's gender and number:\n\nel perro negro → los perros negros\nla casa blanca → las casas blancas\n\nNegro and blanco change shape when pluralized: negro → negros, blanco → blancas."
        }
