          "type": "text",
          "title": "Only three endings matter",
          "body": "Notice that only three of the six endings are unique:\n\n-AR verbs:  yo -o   tú -as   él -a   nosotros -amos   vosotros -áis   ellos -an\n\n- 'o' covers yo, tú, él, nosotros, ellos.\n- 'as' and 'áis' cover tú and vosotros.\n- 'a' covers él.\n\nIf you only remember the -o/-as/-a pattern you can already fill in the whole table."
